exports[`BreakerPanel（披露留存型只读面板） > closed 态可视：闭合（正常） > breaker-closed 1`] = `"<div class="flex flex-col gap-3" data-testid="ops-breaker-panel"><section data-testid="ops-breaker-state" aria-label="Fabric 引擎断路器" class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-md border border-edge-subtle bg-surface-raised p-3"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="min-w-0"><h3 class="text-body font-semibold text-ink">Fabric 引擎断路器</h3><p class="text-micro text-ink-muted">engine_breaker 披露 · 最近一次客户端接收</p></div><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 whitespace-nowrap rounded-pill border px-1.5 py-0.5 text-micro font-medium border-status-success-border bg-status-success-soft text-status-success">闭合（正常）</span></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3" role="img" aria-label="断路器状态 闭合（正常）"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-pill border-2 border-status-success-border bg-status-success-soft text-status-success"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15.914 4a1.5 1.5 0 00-2.474-1.561l-9 9A1.5 1.5 0 005.5 14h4.002a.5.5 0 01.471.666L8.086 20a1.5 1.5 0 002.475 1.56l9-9A1.5 1.5 0 0018.5 10h-3.997a.5.5 0 01-.472-.667z"></path></svg></span><div class="grid flex-1 grid-cols-2 gap-1.5"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col rounded-sm border border-edge-subtle bg-surface-sunken px-2 py-1"><span class="truncate text-micro text-ink-muted">连续失败</span><span class="truncate text-meta font-semibold tabular-nums text-ink" title="0/3">0/3</span></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col rounded-sm border border-edge-subtle bg-surface-sunken px-2 py-1"><span class="truncate text-micro text-ink-muted">累计回退</span><span class="truncate text-meta font-semibold tabular-nums text-ink" title="0">0</span></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col rounded-sm border border-edge-subtle bg-surface-sunken px-2 py-1"><span class="truncate text-micro text-ink-muted">半开冷却剩余</span><span class="truncate text-meta font-semibold tabular-nums text-ink" title="—">—</span></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col rounded-sm border border-edge-subtle bg-surface-sunken px-2 py-1"><span class="truncate text-micro text-ink-muted">披露接收</span><span class="truncate text-meta font-semibold tabular-nums text-ink" title="HH:MM:SS">HH:MM:SS</span></div></div></div><p class="text-micro text-ink-muted">数据通道：data-fabric 联邦查询响应的内嵌披露（v6 引擎回退 v5 时携带）——非轮询端点，时间线可能有间隙。已记协调点：请求独立只读端点。</p></section><section data-testid="ops-cache-disclosure" aria-label="结果缓存命中" class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-md border border-edge-subtle bg-surface-raised p-3"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="min-w-0"><h3 class="text-body font-semibold text-ink">结果缓存命中</h3><p class="text-micro text-ink-muted">result_cache 披露 · basis=ttl+fingerprint[+distributed]</p></div><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 text-micro text-ink-muted"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-hard-drive" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 16h.01"></path><path d="M2.212 11.577a2 2 0 0 0-.212.896V18a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-5.527a2 2 0 0 0-.212-.896L18.55 5.11A2 2 0 0 0 16.76 4H7.24a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11z"></path><path d="M21.946 12.013H2.054"></path><path d="M6 16h.01"></path></svg></span></div></div><div class="rounded-sm border border-dashed border-edge-subtle bg-surface-sunken px-3 py-3"><p class="text-meta font-medium text-ink-secondary">尚未收到缓存披露</p><p class="mt-1 text-micro text-ink-muted">result_cache 披露随缓存命中的联邦查询响应下发；当前会话暂无命中记录。</p></div></section><p class="text-micro text-ink-muted">留存条目：1（LRU 有界）。聚合命中率统计（stats()）后端无 HTTP 端