exports[`BreakerPanel（披露留存型只读面板） > 从未收到披露 → 诚实空态（无假数据） > breaker-empty 1`] = `"<div class="flex flex-col gap-3" data-testid="ops-breaker-panel"><section data-testid="ops-breaker-state" aria-label="Fabric 引擎断路器" class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-md border border-edge-subtle bg-surface-raised p-3"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="min-w-0"><h3 class="text-body font-semibold text-ink">Fabric 引擎断路器</h3><p class="text-micro text-ink-muted">engine_breaker 披露 · 最近一次客户端接收</p></div></div><div class="rounded-sm border border-dashed border-edge-subtle bg-surface-sunken px-3 py-3"><p class="text-meta font-medium text-ink-secondary">尚未收到任何断路器披露</p><p class="mt-1 text-micro text-ink-muted">披露只随 federation 查询回退路径下发；当前会话未发生引擎回退（这是好事）。状态不可轮询——无独立端点（协调点）。</p></div></section><section data-testid="ops-cache-disclosure" aria-label="结果缓存命中" class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-md border border-edge-subtle bg-surface-raised p-3"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="min-w-0"><h3 class="text-body font-semibold text-ink">结果缓存命中</h3><p class="text-micro text-ink-muted">result_cache 披露 · basis=ttl+fingerprint[+distributed]</p></div><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 text-micro text-ink-muted"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-hard-drive" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 16h.01"></path><path d="M2.212 11.577a2 2 0 0 0-.212.896V18a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-5.527a2 2 0 0 0-.212-.896L18.55 5.11A2 2 0 0 0 16.76 4H7.24a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11z"></path><path d="M21.946 12.013H2.054"></path><path d="M6 16h.01"></path></svg></span></div></div><div class="rounded-sm border border-dashed border-edge-subtle bg-surface-sunken px-3 py-3"><p class="text-meta font-medium text-ink-secondary">尚未收到缓存披露</p><p class="mt-1 text-micro text-ink-muted">result_cache 披露随缓存命中的联邦查询响应下发；当前会话暂无命中记录。</p></div></section><p class="text-micro text-ink-muted">留存条目：0（LRU 有界）。聚合命中率统计（stats()）后端无 HTTP 端点 —— 仅能展示逐次披露，不能虚构命中率曲线。</p></div>"`;
